        557.9973754882812,
        258.2515563964844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ball) and cost function. The first control from the control sequence with the lowest total cost (opaque orange line) is applied to the robot and repeated",
